  "remaining_gaps": [
    "Engine.Run still returns UnsupportedError; no PHP source/bytecode VM integration in this package.",
    "Structured diagnostic order is tested; PHP source positions, stack rendering, exception handlers and class matching require VM integration.",
    "Engine cancellation/admission/drain and hard worker termination remain downstream integration.",
    "Request-local chdir, putenv, INI and timezone behavior remains unimplemented.",
    "HTTP headers, Cookie, HEAD and client disconnect behavior remain downstream integration.",
    "No Session serializer or upload progress support is claimed; REQ-044/T-087/T-088 remain not_run.",
    "Historical PHP profiles and other platforms are not certified by the modern Linux arm64 oracle.",
    "Go callbacks/writers cannot be forcibly stopped in the same process. Cleanup timeout may leave the Request in ResourceCleanup.",
    "Returning live PHP objects or recursive arrays through the local W-06 snapshot helper remains rejected; public opaque descriptors require the SDK/VM bridge.",
    "True PHP by-reference returns and unused-expression destruction order require an explicit VM result-disposition contract. outputFilter expects already-adapted bytes and endNormal for successful callback output."
  ],
